91 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 65 0 R
/T (Existing phishing detection techniques mainly rely on blacklist databases and manual rule-based systems, which are unable to detect newly generated phishing websites effectively. This limitation increases the risk of cyberattacks and data theft. Therefore, there is a need for an intelligent, scalable, and automated phishing detection framework capable of accurately identifying phishing websites in real time using Machine Learning.)
/E (Existing phishing detection techniques mainly rely on blacklist databases and manual rule-based systems, which are unable to detect newly generated phishing websites effectively. This limitation increases the risk of cyberattacks and data theft. Therefore, there is a need for an intelligent, scalable, and automated phishing detection framework capable of accurately identifying phishing websites in real time using Machine Learning.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
