<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (The AI-Based Phishing Detection Framework successfully demonstrates the use of Machine Learning for identifying phishing websites. The developed system combines URL feature extraction, Random Forest classification, a React-based frontend, and a Flask backend to provide accurate and real-time phishing detection. The project improved practical knowledge of Machine Learning, Web Development, REST API integration, cloud deployment, and collaborative software development. The developed framework provides an effective and scalable cybersecurity solution that can be extended for real-world phishing detection applications.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
